'''Skull Ridge Mountain''' was a snow-covered mountain on the [[planet]] [[Lanupa]]. It was once home to [[Captain Rennod's Lair]] owned by [[Dread pirate]] [[Tak Rennod]]. By the time of the [[New Republic Era]] the [[Skull Ridge Mountain Hotel & Spa]] was situated on top of the mountain.<ref name="Learn About Pirates" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Skull Ridge Mountain appeared in "[[You Have a Lot to Learn About Pirates]],"<ref name="Learn About Pirates" /> the fifth episode of ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'', which premiered on [[December 25]], [[2024]].<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|starwars|status/1861409832349172011|''[[Star Wars]]''|date=2024-11-26|quote=Mark your calendars. 🗓️ On December 2, stream the two-episode series premiere of #SkeletonCrew, only on @DisneyPlus.|archiveurl=https://ghostarchive.org/archive/uxgSx|archivefile=File:StarWars-SkeletonCrewSchedule-Twitter.png}}</ref>

